---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "AI Development Workflow - tfplan2md"
description: "tfplan2md is developed using a multi-agent AI workflow where specialized agents handle different phases of the development lifecycle."
permalink: /ai-workflow.html
rootPrefix: ""
navKey: "ai-workflow"
pageId: "ai-workflow"
---
<!-- markdownlint-disable MD033 -->
{% from "components/content-blocks.njk" import heroBlock %}

{{ heroBlock(aiWorkflowPage.hero.title, aiWorkflowPage.hero.subtitle, "hero", "", "", { highlightText: aiWorkflowPage.hero.highlightText }) }}

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Overview</h2>
    {% for paragraph in aiWorkflowPage.overview %}
    <p class="content-text">{{ paragraph }}</p>
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="workflow-benefits">
      {% for benefit in aiWorkflowPage.benefits %}
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon">{{ benefit.icon }}</div>
        <h3>{{ benefit.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ benefit.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">{{ aiWorkflowPage.diagram.title }}</h2>
    <p class="content-text">{{ aiWorkflowPage.diagram.description }}</p>

    <div class="diagram-container ai-workflow-diagram-shell">
      <object data="ai-workflow.svg" type="image/svg+xml" class="ai-workflow-diagram-object"></object>
    </div>

    <p class="diagram-note ai-workflow-diagram-note">
      <em>{{ aiWorkflowPage.diagram.note }}</em>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Key Agents</h2>
    <div class="agent-grid">
      {% for agent in aiWorkflowPage.agents %}
      <div class="agent-card"><div class="agent-emoji">{{ agent.emoji }}</div><h3>{{ agent.title }}</h3><p>{{ agent.description }}</p></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">How It Works</h2>
    <div class="process-steps">
      {% for step in aiWorkflowPage.processSteps %}
      <div class="process-step"><div class="step-number">{{ step.number }}</div><div class="step-content"><h3>{{ step.title }}</h3><p>{{ step.description }}</p></div></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Dual-Mode Execution</h2>
    <p class="content-text">
      The workflow supports both local (VS Code) and cloud (GitHub) execution modes, enabling both interactive development and automated workflows.
    </p>

    <div class="execution-modes">
      {% for mode in aiWorkflowPage.executionModes %}
      <div class="mode-card">
        <h3>{{ mode.title }}</h3>
        <ul>
          {% for item in mode.items %}
          <li>{{ item }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Learn More</h2>
    <p class="content-text">
      This page provides a high-level overview of the AI workflow. For complete details including artifact formats, handoff criteria, and best practices, see the full documentation.
    </p>

    <div class="cta-buttons">
      {% for cta in aiWorkflowPage.ctas %}
      <a href="{{ cta.href }}" class="btn btn-{{ cta.variant }} btn-lg"{% if cta.external %} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}>{{ cta.label }}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
